      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚙️ **Config:** `bridge/config.json` — set your API keys here",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "commands-note",
      "x": -1200,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Commands\n```\n# Chat with one AI\nnode index.js chat \\\n  --ai claude \\\n  \"Your question\"\n\n# Compare all AIs\nnode index.js compare \\\n  \"Your question\"\n\n# Daily brief\nnode index.js brief\n\n# Search vault\nnode index.js search \\\n  \"topic\"\n```"
    }
  ],
